Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:25.70,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, lad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在我领地里干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing on my property?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.71,0:01:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是来讨回\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come to claim back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.92,0:01:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}属于我的东西 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's rightfully mine, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.75,0:01:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个小流氓\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thieving young rascal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.42,0:01:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偷了我一些马蹄铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}made off with some horseshoes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.17,0:01:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有包钉子 从我铁匠铺里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a bag of nails from my smithy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.06,0:01:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有什么证据？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is your proof?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.52,0:01:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}证据就是 赃物就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The proof is, I'll find them there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.94,0:01:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可不要逼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't want to be forced{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.27,0:01:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去叫警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}to call the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.57,0:02:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些人是我的客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people are guests of mine, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.70,0:02:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你却是私闯民宅 肖恩先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you are trespassing, Mr. Thorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可不怕你 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not afraid of you, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.12,0:02:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从我的地盘滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off my land!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.95,0:02:33.58,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《斑点带子案》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.03,0:02:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请尽快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, come back soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.57,0:02:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的 根本没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear, there is nothing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.33,0:02:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever to worry about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.33,0:02:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过不了几周我们就结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be married in a few weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.62,0:02:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要启程回伦敦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just on my way back to London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.34,0:02:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见 先生 感谢您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, sir, and thank you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.34,0:03:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个周末我非常愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a most pleasant weekend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.01,0:03:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一定会在提升我的棋艺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean to improve my game of chess{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.64,0:03:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下次造访咱们再看\N{\fnArial\fs30}before my next visit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.26,0:03:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是个不容小看的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't an unworthy opponent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.98,0:03:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.98,0:03:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去把珀西送到门口 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just seeing Percy down to the gates, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.62,0:03:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}驶到大门口等我 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive on and wait for me by the gate, will you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.56,0:03:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那家伙私闯民宅\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fellow was trespassing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.23,0:04:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给他浸浸水 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}he had a dunking, and that is all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.65,0:04:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲 我不信肖恩会故意…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, I cannot believe that Thorn would deliberate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.32,0:04:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死 女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dammit, woman, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也跟他们合谋反对我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you part of the conspiracy against me, too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 父亲 我住这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Father, I live here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.43,0:04:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for much longer, eh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.30,0:04:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就要和那个阿米蒂其结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}once you marry that fellow Armitage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.34,0:05:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, what is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.76,0:05:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲 我的房间怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, what has happened to my room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}工人们发现一处结构失调\N{\fnArial\fs30}The builders found a fault in the structure, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.06,0:05:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最好睡在你姐姐的房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}better sleep in your sister's room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.43,0:05:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等他们修缮完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}till they've finished working on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.44,0:05:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朱丽亚的房间 我不能睡那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julia's room, I can't sleep in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.82,0:05:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么不能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not, Pray?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.74,0:05:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.91,0:05:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the matter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.32,0:05:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那屋子好得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a perfectly good room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经叫管家收拾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've instructed the housekeeper to prepare it for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.54,0:05:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去拿行李 搬过去 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now run along, your baggage, and goodnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.61,0:06:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好啊 小美人 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello there young beauty, good night, good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.93,0:08:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very sorry, Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.31,0:08:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但今早人人都不走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it seems to be the common lot this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.65,0:08:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈德森夫人被吵醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Hudson has been roused, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.90,0:08:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她来叫我 我来叫你\N{\fnArial\fs30}she retorted on me, and I on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.15,0:08:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但现在才七点一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's only a quarter past seven, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}房子着火了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is it, a fire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.53,0:08:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 是一位客户\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, No, a client.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一会才能烧起来 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will take a moment to draw, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.83,0:08:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但就一会儿 哈德森太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only a moment, Mrs. Hudson is a mistress{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.88,0:08:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是升火的行家\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the art of fire lighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.51,0:08:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 这是我最好的伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, this is my intimate friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.67,0:08:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是助手 华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and associate, Dr. Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.55,0:08:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以在他面前畅谈 就像在我面前一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}before whom you may speak as freely as before myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.51,0:08:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.35,0:08:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈德森太太 你能不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Hudson, do you think you could{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.85,0:08:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给这位女士来杯热咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}bring this young lady a hot cup of coffee, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发现在你在颤抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}for I observed you are shivering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我并不是冻得发抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not cold which makes me shiver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是害怕 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is fear, Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.62,0:09:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is terror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.12,0:09:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你无须害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must not fear, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.62,0:09:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会把事情处理好\N{\fnArial\fs30}we shall set matters right, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不必疑虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}have no doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.13,0:09:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今早你是乘火车来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have come by train, I see, this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么说你认识我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我只是看到了半截回程票\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but I observed the second half of a return ticket{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你左手手套里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the palm of your left glove.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.60,0:09:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很早就动身了 先乘马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You started early, but you had a drive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.18,0:09:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两轮马车 经过一段泥路\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a dog-cart, along heavy roads, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.39,0:09:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才到达火车站\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you reached the station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.19,0:09:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这没什么神秘的 年轻的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no mystery, my dear lady, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.15,0:09:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您上衣的左边袖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}the left arm of your jacket{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}溅上了泥点\N{\fnArial\fs30}is spattered with mud{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.40,0:09:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不少于七处\N{\fnArial\fs30}in no less than seven places, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.24,0:09:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}泥迹还未干\N{\fnArial\fs30}the marks are fresh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.11,0:09:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唯有一种交通工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no vehicle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是两轮马车 会溅起\N{\fnArial\fs30}save a dog-cart which throws up mud{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.74,0:09:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么特别的泥点\N{\fnArial\fs30}in that particular way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.54,0:09:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且只有当你坐在\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then only when you sit on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.54,0:09:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}车夫左手边时才可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}the left-hand side of the driver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.17,0:09:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说的太对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are perfectly correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.33,0:09:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 我再也不能承受这种紧张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I can stand the strain no longer;{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再这样下去我要疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall go mad if it continues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.88,0:09:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从费林托夫人那里听说了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have heard of you from Mrs. Farintosh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.38,0:10:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你曾帮助她度过了困境\N{\fnArial\fs30}whom you helped in the hour of her sore need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.26,0:10:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}费林托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Farintosh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲爱的海伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Helen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.11,0:10:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很难给你什么建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is difficult for me to advise you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你给我的情况太少\N{\fnArial\fs30}since you present so few facts, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.61,0:10:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我知道你是个聪明的姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I know you to be a sensible girl, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.11,0:10:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会随便猜疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}not prone to hysterics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.62,0:10:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是你可怜的母亲的最老的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was one of your poor, dear mother's oldest friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.91,0:10:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只能建议你 如果一直恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can only suggest that if your fears persist, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.50,0:10:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去找夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}you should contact Mr. Sherlock Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.84,0:10:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贝克街221B\N{\fnArial\fs30}221B Baker Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.26,0:10:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}费林托 对了 我记得那个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Farintosh, oh, yes, I do remember the case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.72,0:10:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是关于头冠上的猫眼石\N{\fnArial\fs30}It concerned an opal tiara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.30,0:10:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该发生在你来之前 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it was before your time, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.60,0:10:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 哈德森太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.69,0:10:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 你是否也可以帮助我呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, do you not think you could help me, too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.36,0:10:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}目前 我还没办法酬谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}At present it is out of my power to reward you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.61,0:10:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但几周后我就要结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in a few weeks I should be married{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.48,0:10:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到时就可以支配我的收入\N{\fnArial\fs30}with control of my own income.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:11:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很乐意帮助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall be happy to devote the same care{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.61,0:11:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像帮助你的朋友一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}to your case as to that of your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.83,0:11:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至于酬谢 我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}As to reward my profession{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本身就是酬劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}is its own reward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.70,0:11:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是你也可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are at liberty to defray{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.33,0:11:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随意付给我些酬劳 在你认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever expenses I may be put to at the time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.17,0:11:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}合适的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}which suits you best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.75,0:11:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在请告诉我们事情的全部经过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I beg you, lay everything before us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.96,0:11:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以便于我们作出初步判断\N{\fnArial\fs30}which may help us form an opinion upon this matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.55,0:11:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我叫海伦·斯通\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Helen Stoner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.22,0:11:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和我继父住在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I live with my stepfather, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.97,0:11:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格林斯比·罗依罗德医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Grimesby Roylott, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.72,0:11:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是英国最老的撒克逊家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is the last survivor of one of the oldest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.10,0:11:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唯一的后裔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saxon families in England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.69,0:11:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯托克摩兰的罗依罗德\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Roylotts of Stoke Moran, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.27,0:11:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个名字似曾相识\N{\fnArial\fs30}the name is familiar to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.36,0:11:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的职业是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a doctor by profession, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.44,0:11:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}经验丰富\N{\fnArial\fs30}a skilled one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.28,0:11:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他曾经行医多年 名誉卓著\N{\fnArial\fs30}For some years he had a large and flourishing practice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.61,0:11:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在印度 加尔各答\N{\fnArial\fs30}in India, in Calcutta.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.91,0:11:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生医生也曾在印度行医\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Watson has also practiced medicine in India.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 跟随诺森伯兰第五火枪团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, attached to the Fifth Northumberland Fusiliers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请继续 斯通小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray continue, Miss Stoner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.05,0:12:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在加尔各答 他娶了我母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Calcutta, he married my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.84,0:12:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是一名少校留下的年轻寡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the young widow of Major mother's remarriage, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.64,0:12:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时我只有两岁 我姐姐朱丽亚五岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my sister, Julia, was five years older.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.98,0:12:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我母亲有一大笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our mother had a considerable sum of money…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.44,0:12:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一年进项不少于一千磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}not less than a thousand a year…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些她全留给了罗依罗德医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this she bequeathed to Dr. Roylott entirely{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.86,0:12:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们和他住\N{\fnArial\fs30}while we resided with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 你母亲过世了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, your mother has passed on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.28,0:12:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们回英国后不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shortly after our return to England, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.41,0:12:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她出了事\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was killed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一次铁路交通意外 靠近科尔的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a railway accident near Crewe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.63,0:12:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后我的继父便放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My stepfather then abandoned his attempts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.59,0:12:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在伦敦开始他事业的初衷\N{\fnArial\fs30}to establish himself in practice in London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.00,0:12:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带着我们搬回了他的祖屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}and took us to live in his ancestral house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.17,0:12:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在斯托克摩兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}at Stoke Moran.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你母亲留给你们的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the money your mother left you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}足以满足你们的需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}was enough for all your wants, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.51,0:12:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你们仍可以过富足的生活？\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that was no obstacle to your happiness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.22,0:12:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我继父发生了可怕的转变\N{\fnArial\fs30}A terrible change came over my stepfather, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.27,0:12:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不和人交朋友 也不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of making friends and exchanging visits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:12:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜访邻居\N{\fnArial\fs30}with our neighbors, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.90,0:12:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们一开始十分高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}who at first were overjoyed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.23,0:13:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到罗依罗德家人回到故乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see a Roylott back in the family seat, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.03,0:13:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他把自己关在房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}he shut himself up in the house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.78,0:13:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沉湎于和人疯狂争斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and indulged in ferocious quarrels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从那时到现在 我们很难避免\N{\fnArial\fs30}At times it was and still is hard to keep him out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他进警察局\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the police courts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.24,0:13:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他成了村中一霸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's become the terror of the village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.95,0:13:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他允许别人拜访吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he permit any visitors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 除了我的未婚夫和一些流浪的吉普赛人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, except my fianc?and some wandering gypsies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.71,0:13:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉普赛人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gypsies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.21,0:13:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}流浪者 他允许他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vagabonds, whom he has given leave{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.21,0:13:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他的土地上扎营\N{\fnArial\fs30}to encamp on his land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.84,0:13:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时 他和他们一出去就是好几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes he goes away with them for days at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.14,0:13:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以从我的描述中看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can imagine from what I'm saying{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.56,0:13:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可怜的姐姐朱莉亚和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my poor sister Julia and I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}生活中几乎没什么乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}had no great pleasure in our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.10,0:13:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仆人都待不了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}No servant would stay long{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.98,0:13:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的家务都是我们俩做\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we did all the work of the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.57,0:13:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她年仅三十岁就去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was but 30 when I lost her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那时她的头发已经花白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but already her hair had begun to whiten, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.82,0:13:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和我的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}even as mine has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.12,0:13:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你姐姐死了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister is dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.20,0:13:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在两年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just two years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.00,0:13:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这正是我想要和您讲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is of that I wish to talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我们这样的生活中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living the life we did, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.34,0:14:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几乎不可能见到\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were little likely to see anyone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.93,0:14:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我们地位年龄相仿的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}of our own age and position, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.26,0:14:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但偶尔我们也会允许有些拜访\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we were occasionally allowed short visits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.85,0:14:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two years ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朱丽亚遇到了一个半薪海军少校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julia met a half-pay major of marines, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.81,0:14:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后他们订婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to whom she became engaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.23,0:14:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}征得你继父的同意了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your stepfather approved of the match?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.15,0:14:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他根本就没有一点反对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He raised no objection at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.53,0:14:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}婚前两星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fortnight before the wedding, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.95,0:14:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生了一件可怕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}a terrible event occurred{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.87,0:14:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夺走了我唯一的伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}which deprived me of my only companion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请说的详细些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Praybe precise as to details.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.21,0:14:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is easy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.05,0:14:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那晚每一幕都烙在我脑海中\N{\fnArial\fs30}every event of that night is seared into my memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.39,0:14:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那天深夜 大约十一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was late, about 11:00, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.23,0:15:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朱丽亚跑到了我的屋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julia had come into my room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他又在抽那些难闻的雪茄了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's smoking those awful cigars again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.49,0:15:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你婚礼前应该住这个房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you should have this room until the wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.63,0:15:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 海伦 我真幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Helen, oh, I feel so happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.59,0:15:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我也担心把你一个人留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet wretched that I'm leaving you here alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.22,0:15:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我迟早也会离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My turn will come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.56,0:15:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会想你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall miss you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.23,0:15:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用 我会去看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you won't, I'll come and stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.73,0:15:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另外 你的少校也答应给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, your major has promised to find me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.19,0:15:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}介绍一个相同级别的军官\N{\fnArial\fs30}a brother officer of equal rank, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.40,0:15:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝对比他英俊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and infinitely better looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.45,0:16:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My darling, what is the matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.88,0:16:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}海伦 你听到过有人吹口哨吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helen, have you ever heard anyone whistle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.59,0:16:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在深夜里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the dead of night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.63,0:16:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你睡觉时该不会吹口哨吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you couldn't possibly whistle yourself, in your sleep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.39,0:16:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然不能 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly not, why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这几天夜里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last few nights, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.06,0:16:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大约凌晨三点\N{\fnArial\fs30}always about 3:00 in the morning, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.81,0:16:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我总会被微弱而清晰的口哨吵醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been woken by a low, clear whistle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.07,0:16:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也说不出是哪儿传来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell where it's coming from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.78,0:16:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还以为你也听到了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you might have heard it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.28,0:16:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我睡得比你沉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sleep more heavily than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.24,0:16:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能是那些吉普赛人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was probably those wretched gypsies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.58,0:16:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}算了 不管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, never mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.11,0:17:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们在晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it your custom always{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.73,0:17:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总会锁好门窗吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to lock yourself in at night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.78,0:17:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会的 我继父热爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always, my stepfather has a passion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.03,0:17:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}饲养印度动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Indian animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.32,0:17:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一只豹子 一只狒狒\N{\fnArial\fs30}A leopard and baboon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.20,0:17:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我们庄园里活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}wander freely over the grounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.54,0:17:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朱莉亚和我总觉得不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julia and I had no feelings of security{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.62,0:17:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除非把门窗锁上\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless our doors and windows were locked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.46,0:17:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我睡不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't sleep, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.09,0:17:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有种很不好的预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a vague feeling of misfortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.98,0:17:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朱丽亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.29,0:18:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.59,0:18:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 天哪 海伦 是带子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, Helen, It was the band…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一条斑点带子\N{\fnArial\fs30}the speckled band.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.15,0:18:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去叫父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.49,0:18:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.95,0:18:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回房间去 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go into your room child, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里我来处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll deal with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.27,0:19:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.36,0:19:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我姐姐和我很亲密\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister and I were very close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.32,0:19:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.45,0:19:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多么悲伤的经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a mournful experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.17,0:19:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你完全不知道是什么引起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you've no idea what might have caused…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.34,0:19:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这阵口哨和金属声\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whistle and metallic sound, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.09,0:19:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你肯定听到了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can swear to it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.18,0:19:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我印象很深\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my strong impression, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.68,0:19:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但也有可能是被误导了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may possibly have been deceived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.68,0:19:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你姐姐当时穿好衣服了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was your sister dressed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.35,0:19:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 她穿着睡衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, she was in her night dress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.77,0:19:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地板上有支蜡烛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, on the floor there was a candle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.19,0:19:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有截火柴头\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the charred stump of a match.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就是说 她被什么东西吵醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means, something must have woken her up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.32,0:19:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}点起蜡烛想看看发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she struck a light to see what the matter was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.91,0:19:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}验尸官的结论是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What conclusions did the coroner come to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.12,0:20:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他很仔细地做了调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}He investigated the case with great care, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.87,0:20:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他没发现任何合理的死因\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he was unable to find any satisfactory cause of death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.71,0:20:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根据你的描述\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your evidence would have shown{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.46,0:20:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}门是从里面锁上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the door was fastened on the inner side, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.25,0:20:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}窗也关的很严实 每晚都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}the windows blocked by shutters, secured every night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.26,0:20:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此 可以确定的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is certain, therefore, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.97,0:20:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你姐姐是独自一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your sister was alone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.72,0:20:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走向死亡的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she met her end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.72,0:20:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.27,0:20:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另外 她身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, there were no marks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.89,0:20:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也没有打斗的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}of violence upon her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.23,0:20:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会是投毒吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about poison?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.77,0:20:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医生查了 没查出中毒迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctors examined her for it, without success.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.36,0:20:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你认为 这位不幸的女士是怎么死的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think this unfortunate lady died of, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.62,0:20:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信她死于\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my belief that she died{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.66,0:20:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}纯粹的恐惧和精神焦虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}of pure fear and nervous shock, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.59,0:20:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管我不知道是什么让她如此受惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}though what it was which frightened her I cannot imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.76,0:20:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得她说的带子是什么意思 斑点带子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you gather from the allusion to a band, a speckled band?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.26,0:21:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胡话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delirium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.18,0:21:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或是戴着带子的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or some band of people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.77,0:21:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}庄园里的吉普赛人会把\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gypsies at the plantation have spotted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.81,0:21:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斑点手帕系在脖子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}handkerchiefs they wear around their necks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.07,0:21:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里面有很多隐情\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are very deep waters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.70,0:21:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你姐姐死后发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened after your sister's death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.12,0:21:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的生活更寂寞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life was lonelier than ever{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.00,0:21:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到一个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}until a month ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.63,0:21:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的一个好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}when a dear friend of mine, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.55,0:21:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相识多年的\N{\fnArial\fs30}whom I have known for many years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.30,0:21:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他盛情向我求婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}did me the honor to ask for my hand in marriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.97,0:21:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他叫珀西阿米蒂其\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Mr. Percy Armitage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.09,0:21:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们几周内就要结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are to be married within a few weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.10,0:21:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你为什么来找我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what prompted you to come here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.68,0:21:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的生活似乎走上了正轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}when your life seems set so fair?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.18,0:21:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨天 房子的修葺开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday, some repairs were started{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.23,0:21:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的房间被穿了个洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my bedroom wall was pierced, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.36,0:21:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以昨晚我只能\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that last night I was forced{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.15,0:21:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}搬到朱莉亚死去的屋子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}to move into the chamber in which Julia died, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.86,0:21:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就睡在那张\N{\fnArial\fs30}to sleep in the very bed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.32,0:21:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她临死睡的床上\N{\fnArial\fs30}in which she slept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.82,0:22:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想想我有多恐惧 半夜里被\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine my terror when I was woken by the same{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.20,0:22:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}预示她死亡的低低哨音惊醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}low whistle which had been the herald of her own death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.00,0:22:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你点了灯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lit a lamp?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.37,0:22:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 但什么也没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but nothing was to be seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.71,0:22:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我害怕得睡不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was too shaken to sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.33,0:22:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}便穿好衣服溜出了房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dressed and slipped out of the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.00,0:22:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在皇冠旅馆找到辆马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a dog-cart at the Crown Inn, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.55,0:22:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赶到伦敦 只有一个目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and came to London with one objective, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.38,0:22:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}征求你的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}asking your advice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.05,0:22:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很明智\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did wisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.64,0:22:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可你全都告诉我了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But have you told me all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.64,0:22:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.35,0:22:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 斯通小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have not, Miss Stoner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.98,0:22:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在袒护你的继父\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are shielding your stepfather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.74,0:22:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他很严苛 可他仍然\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a hard man, but he's still{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.66,0:22:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我唯一的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only father I have known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.08,0:22:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想到早饭时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say it was time for some breakfast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.04,0:22:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还有许多细节要了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are a thousand details I desire to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.54,0:22:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不然我无法行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I decide on a course of action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.84,0:22:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们今天去斯托克摩兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we were to come to Stoke Moran today, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.09,0:22:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能看看这些房间吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}could we see over these rooms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.67,0:23:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你继父不知道的情况下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}without the knowledge of your stepfather?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.13,0:23:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刚好 他说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}As it happens, he spoke of coming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.55,0:23:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天要来城里办事\N{\fnArial\fs30}to town today on some business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.22,0:23:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那工人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the workmen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.35,0:23:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have seen none.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.31,0:23:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有一个本村的女仆 来做打扫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a woman who comes to clean from the village, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.06,0:23:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但只在早上\N{\fnArial\fs30}but only in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.43,0:23:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那儿应该没什么人打搅你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There should be nothing to disturb you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.80,0:23:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.35,0:23:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 你不会介意跑一趟吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson, you are not averse to this trip?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.27,0:23:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}By no means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.40,0:23:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们午后去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we will be with you in the early afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.40,0:23:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会等你们到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall be there for your arrival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.07,0:23:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真不留下吃早饭吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll stay for some breakfast, surely?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.78,0:23:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.21,0:23:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我心里轻松了不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart is lightened already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.60,0:23:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈德森太太 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Mrs. Hudson, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.10,0:23:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当你联想夜半的哨音\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you combine the ideas of whistles at night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.11,0:24:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一群吉普赛人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the presence of a band of gypsies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.11,0:24:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和他们过从甚密的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}on intimate terms with the doctor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.44,0:24:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一个斑点带子的遗言时\N{\fnArial\fs30}the dying allusion to a speckled band, well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.45,0:24:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全可以相信奥秘\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's good ground to believe that the mystery{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.54,0:24:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在这些线索里\N{\fnArial\fs30}may be cleared along those lines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.46,0:24:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪一个是福尔摩斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one of you is Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.67,0:24:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.13,0:24:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你应该先自我介绍一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have the advantage of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.97,0:24:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是格莱斯比·罗依罗德医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Dr. Grimesby Roylott, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.64,0:24:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来自斯托克摩兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Stoke Moran.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.27,0:24:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗 医生 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed, Doctor, please take a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.31,0:24:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我才不听你使唤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall do nothing of the kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.86,0:24:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道我的继女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that my stepdaughter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.65,0:24:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今早来过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been here this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.74,0:24:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她对你说了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What has she been saying to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.32,0:24:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今年这时候比往年冷些\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a little cold for the time of the year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.66,0:24:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她对你说了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What has she been saying to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.62,0:24:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我听说庄稼收成不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have heard that the crops promise well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.50,0:25:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在耍我 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you put me off, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.54,0:25:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这个无赖 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scoundrel, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.80,0:25:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以前听说过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard of you before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.42,0:25:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就是福尔摩斯 爱管闲事的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Holmes, the meddler, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.34,0:25:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 挑事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes the busybody, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.55,0:25:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 苏格兰场芝麻官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, the Scotland Yard Jack-in-office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.60,0:25:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和你谈话真的很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your conversation really is most entertaining, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.02,0:25:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请你离开时\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you would close the door, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.23,0:25:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随手关门 貌似有阵微风吹过\N{\fnArial\fs30}on your way out, as there is a decided draft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.61,0:25:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不说完自然不会走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will go when I have said my say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.82,0:25:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你吃豹子胆了 敢管我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you dare to interfere in my affairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.99,0:25:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道斯通小姐来过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that Miss Stoner has been here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.72,0:25:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}惹了我可没好果子吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a dangerous man to fall foul of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.56,0:26:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 哈德森太太 只是个客户而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mrs. Hudson, just another client.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.94,0:26:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多么可亲的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a very amiable person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.32,0:26:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可能没那么大块头 可是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may not be quite so bulky, but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.25,0:26:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他实在太傲慢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}fancy his having the insolence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.79,0:26:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}竟然把我跟官方探员混为一谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}to confound me with the official detective force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.59,0:26:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这倒使案子更有趣味了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, this incident gives zest to our investigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.92,0:26:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是希望我们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only hope our friend won't suffer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.59,0:26:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会为轻率地留下了行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}from her imprudence in allowing that brute{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.59,0:26:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而吃苦头\N{\fnArial\fs30}to trace her here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.26,0:26:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一直在想一个问题 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thought keeps nagging at me, Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.56,0:26:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗依罗德在印度的职业生涯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roylott's professional life in India, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.27,0:26:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果那么成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it was so successful, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.73,0:26:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么他会回来过这种\N{\fnArial\fs30}why would he exchange it for a life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.56,0:26:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没落贵族的生活？\N{\fnArial\fs30}of aristocratic penury?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.73,0:26:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我朋友库默可能会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend Cooms would know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.53,0:26:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}库默当时也在加尔各答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cooms was in Calcutta around that time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.49,0:26:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到你的朋友库默\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find your friend Cooms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.95,0:26:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看我们从他那里能得到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see what you can get from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.70,0:26:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要去趟医师协会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall walk down to Doctors' Commons, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.95,0:26:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望能得到一些资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I hope to get some data{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.83,0:27:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能会对案子有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}which may help us in this matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.75,0:27:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们下午一点在滑铁卢车站大钟下见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us meet again at 1:00 under the clock at Waterloo Station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.67,0:27:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果到时你能吃完早饭的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is, if you've finished your breakfast by then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.30,0:27:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对了 带着你的左轮手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and your revolver, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.80,0:27:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要求你一定要揣在口袋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would be obliged if you would slip it into your pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.93,0:27:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}埃利2号手枪正好对付\N{\fnArial\fs30}An Eley #2 is an excellent argument{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.72,0:27:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能把钢制拨火棍拧弯的先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}against gentlemen who can twist steel pokers into knots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.18,0:27:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有 你的牙刷\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, and your toothbrush, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.44,0:27:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想就这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}are I think all we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.86,0:27:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看了他亡妻的遗嘱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen the will of the deceased wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.49,0:27:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在她死时 她每年的收入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her annual income at the time of her death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.40,0:27:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将近1100磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}was a little short of 1100 pounds, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.20,0:27:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但由于农产品价格下跌\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, due to the fall in agricultural prices, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.24,0:27:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在只有不到750磅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's now no more than 750 pounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.87,0:27:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每一个女儿在结婚后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each girl in case of marriage, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.21,0:27:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都将得到250磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}could claim 250 pounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.92,0:27:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 如果两个女儿都结婚的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if both girls had married, ah, beauty, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.42,0:27:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格莱斯比·罗依罗德的就会少得可怜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grimesby Roylott would have had a mere pittance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.76,0:27:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至其中一个结婚也会毁了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even one marriage would ruin him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.55,0:27:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是最可能的作案动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}The strongest possible motive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.89,0:28:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 你找到库默了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, did you manage to find Cooms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.73,0:28:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.64,0:28:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他真是很难找\N{\fnArial\fs30}He proved rather hard to locate, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.52,0:28:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但最终我还是找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I finally managed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.94,0:28:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在巴兹的斯万松郡\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get him through Swanson at Bards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.32,0:28:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在加尔各答他的确认识罗依罗德\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did know Roylott in Calcutta, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.94,0:28:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}证实了那女孩所说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}confirmed what the girl had said, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.49,0:28:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还说了一件有趣的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and added one intriguing fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.08,0:28:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时发生了多起盗窃案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, it seems that a series of robberies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.87,0:28:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在他的房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}had been perpetrated in his house, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.87,0:28:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嫌疑落到了他的当地管家头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and suspicion fell on his native butler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.33,0:28:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗依罗德当场揪住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roylott promptly seized the man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.96,0:28:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在盛怒之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in a fit of anger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.50,0:28:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把那可怜的人打死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}beat the poor fellow to death, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.55,0:28:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然勉强逃过了死罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}narrowly escaped a capital sentence, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.22,0:28:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他还是坐了很久的牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but suffered a long term of imprisonment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.55,0:28:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回国的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}and returned to this country{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.60,0:28:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已变成了一个阴郁的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}a morose and disappointed man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.56,0:28:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 这真是个罪恶的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Watson, it's a wicked world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.23,0:28:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尤其当一个聪明人把头脑用于犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when a clever man turns his brain to crime, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.32,0:28:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是最糟糕的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's the worst of all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.97,0:29:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们 你们是来渡假的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}On holiday, are you, gentlemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.84,0:29:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我们是建筑师\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're architects, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.18,0:29:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来看看当地的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking a look at some of the local houses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.27,0:29:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你们要去斯托克摩兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, that's why you're wanting Stoke Moran.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.14,0:29:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真没想到是为社交原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think it was for social reasons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.15,0:29:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你们要和罗依罗德医生做生意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be, doing business with Dr. Roylott then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.44,0:29:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我想就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I believe that was the name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.15,0:29:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不介意 我提醒你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't mind a word of warning, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.95,0:29:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要提防着点这个人 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}you want to take care with him, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.53,0:29:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当地的人说\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are some round these parts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.12,0:29:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他脑子有些不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}say he's not right in the head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.29,0:29:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.54,0:29:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在昨天 铁匠肖恩先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only yesterday, Mr. Thorn, the blacksmith, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.62,0:29:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和医生闹得很不愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}had a most nasty experience with the Doctor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.17,0:29:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他让那些吉普赛小偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of those thieving gypsies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.13,0:29:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他那里扎营\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are camped in the grounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.55,0:29:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 我们听说吉普赛人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, we've heard about the gypsies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.26,0:30:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有豹子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the leopard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.43,0:30:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}结果呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The story goes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.35,0:30:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医生把肖恩扔进了河里\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Doctor threw Mr. Thorn in the stream{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.85,0:30:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他脾气失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a fit of uncontrollable temper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.06,0:30:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肖恩先生也是个大个子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that Thorn, he's not a small man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.94,0:30:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老天 那不是要被捕了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Lord, is he bringing a charge of assault?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.90,0:30:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本来是的 但斯通小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was going to, but Miss Stoner, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.19,0:30:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医生的年轻养女\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Doctor's young stepdaughter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.65,0:30:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自掏腰包给了他一些封口费\N{\fnArial\fs30}paid him some of her own money to keep it quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.74,0:30:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是我听到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's what I heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.37,0:30:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我倒没听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.16,0:30:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你呢 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that, Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.96,0:30:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对那位年轻女士的事听得越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more I see and hear of that young lady, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.08,0:30:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就对她越敬佩\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more my admiration increases, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.75,0:30:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确实是精神可嘉的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}young woman of commendable spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.96,0:30:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就停这儿吧 车夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can pull up here, driver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.05,0:30:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是指谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.55,0:30:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然是斯通小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Miss Stoner, of course, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.89,0:30:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}令人敬佩\N{\fnArial\fs30}most admirable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.68,0:30:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 斯通小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, Miss Stoner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.54,0:31:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切都很顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything worked splendidly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.13,0:31:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗依罗德医生去了伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Roylott has gone to London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.50,0:31:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要到晚上才回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he won't be back before the evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.38,0:31:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们以经有幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have already had the pleasure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.05,0:31:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和罗依罗德医生相识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Dr. Roylott's acquaintance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.01,0:31:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 他跟踪我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodness, he followed me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.51,0:31:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 你一走他就进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he turned up just after you left, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.01,0:31:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但福尔摩斯把他嘲笑走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Holmes sent him off with a flea in his ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.06,0:31:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他太狡猾了 我真不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's so cunning, I never know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.60,0:31:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在他身边还有没有安全可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I'm safe from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.64,0:31:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 他也得当心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then, he must guard himself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.73,0:31:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不然他可能发现有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}or he may find someone more cunning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.81,0:31:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这种事上比他更狡猾\N{\fnArial\fs30}than himself upon his track, shall we.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.61,0:31:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 你不认为我们应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, don't you think we ought to get{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.82,0:31:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让斯通小姐今晚离开吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Stoner away from here tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.03,0:31:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好引起猜疑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And arouse suspicion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.24,0:31:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果他来粗的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if he's violent…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.62,0:31:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们守在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.55,0:32:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么这就是罗依罗德医生的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is Dr. Roylott's room, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.43,0:32:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你姐姐原来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}this formerly your sister's, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.43,0:32:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this your room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.93,0:32:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我现在睡这一间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am now sleeping in this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.94,0:32:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 因为修缮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, pending the alterations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.44,0:32:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯通小姐 我可以问个问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Stoner, may I ask something, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.19,0:32:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这有点不寻常吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's unusual, isn't it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.78,0:32:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卧室都设在一楼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}bedrooms on the ground floor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.45,0:32:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卧室都搬下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bedrooms were moved downstairs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.82,0:32:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}房子大部分都在腐坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}when so much of the house fell into decay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.49,0:32:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原来如此 真是可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, of course, how sad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.79,0:32:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这好像没什么可修的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There seems little need for repairs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.71,0:32:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在房子的这一头\N{\fnArial\fs30}to this end of the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.46,0:32:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根本没有 我认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are none, I believe it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.25,0:32:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那只是为了让我换房的借口罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}was an excuse to move me from my room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.80,0:32:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 很有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, that is suggestive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.60,0:32:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯通小姐 能否请你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Stoner, would you be so kind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.64,0:32:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进到你的房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}as to go into the room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.39,0:32:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是你现在的卧室\N{\fnArial\fs30}in which you are now sleeping{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.14,0:32:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后把百叶窗闩好\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bolt the shutters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.45,0:33:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在干什么 华生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing, Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.16,0:33:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在使用你的方法 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm using your methods, Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.66,0:33:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}检查地面上有没有被踩过的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing whether the ground has been disturbed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.33,0:33:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你找到什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what have you come up with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.59,0:33:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想是你的脚印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your footprints, I believe, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.47,0:33:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有我的和斯通小姐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and mine and Miss Stoner's, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.55,0:33:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.87,0:34:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果闩上的话 没人能从这进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one could pass these if they were bolted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.67,0:34:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 让我们看看里面有什么可疑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's see if the inside throws any light on the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.84,0:34:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个铃通什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where does that bell communicate with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.60,0:34:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通女管家的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It goes to the housekeeper's room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.51,0:34:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}似乎比别的东西新\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks newer than the other things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.89,0:34:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 刚安也就两年多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it was only put there a couple of years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.44,0:35:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你姐姐要求的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, your sister asked for it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.10,0:35:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从未听见她用过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never heard of her using it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.61,0:35:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一般自己去取想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to get what we wanted for ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.19,0:35:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗 请原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed, you will excuse me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.07,0:35:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要在地板上好好查一查\N{\fnArial\fs30}while I satisfy myself as to this floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.18,0:35:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不响\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.51,0:35:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.15,0:35:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通往隔壁的通风口\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ventilator into another room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.49,0:35:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说 它可能是用于\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, when it might have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.41,0:36:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和外界交换空气？\N{\fnArial\fs30}communicated with the outside air?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.50,0:36:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那也是新安的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is also quite modern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.29,0:36:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.50,0:36:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯通小姐 如果你允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Stoner, with your permission, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.09,0:36:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要开始检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will now carry our research{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.92,0:36:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗依罗德医生的房间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Dr. Roylott's chamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.53,0:36:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里面有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.28,0:36:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我继父的商业文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}My stepfather's business papers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.03,0:36:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你亲眼看过里面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, you've seen inside it, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.74,0:36:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有一次 几年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only once, some years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.33,0:36:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得里面全是文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember it was full of papers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.04,0:36:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里有猫吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a cat in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.96,0:36:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 干吗这么问？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, what a strange idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.63,0:36:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.55,0:36:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我们不养猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we don't keep a cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.89,0:37:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 豹也算是一种大型猫吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, well, a leopard is a large cat, after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.85,0:37:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 但一小碟牛奶远远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but a saucer of milk wouldn't go far{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.65,0:37:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}填不饱一只豹子\N{\fnArial\fs30}in satisfying a leopard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.36,0:37:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}豹是被皮带拴着的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The leopard is kept on a leash, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.91,0:37:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种皮带吗 华生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This sort of leash, Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.37,0:37:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得它是做什么用的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you make of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.62,0:37:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很普通的狗颈皮带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a common enough dog leash, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.75,0:37:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我不明白为什么要打结\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't know why it should be tied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.96,0:37:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们没有狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.26,0:37:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 斯通小姐 我看得足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Miss Stoner, I have seen enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.99,0:38:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只想问他要不要喝茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going to ask if he'd like some tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.41,0:38:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯通小姐 这至关重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Stoner, it is very essential{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.71,0:38:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得完完全全按我的指示做\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you absolutely follow my advice in every respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.34,0:38:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关系到你性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your life may depend on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.63,0:38:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我保证 我全听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assure you that I'm in your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.97,0:38:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the first place, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.84,0:38:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们来的路上经过了一间小屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the way here we passed a small cottage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.59,0:38:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是杂物间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shill house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.05,0:38:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你姐姐房间的窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will the windows of your sister's room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.72,0:38:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从那儿能看到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}be visible from there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.35,0:38:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.43,0:38:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.60,0:38:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.14,0:38:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们可以待在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we shall make it our base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.69,0:38:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要吃的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some refreshment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.40,0:38:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们先去吃饭吧 福尔摩斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall have dine shalt we, Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.86,0:38:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}村里有旅馆吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a village inn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.45,0:38:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王冠旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Crown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.62,0:38:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.83,0:38:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多谢您的好意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you all the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.87,0:38:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 斯通小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Miss Stoner, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.29,0:38:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等你继父回来以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}when your stepfather returns, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.54,0:38:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得把你自己关在房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must confine yourself in your room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.84,0:38:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}假称你头痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}on pretense of a headache.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.17,0:38:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后 夜里当你听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then when you hear your stepfather{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.63,0:38:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你父亲就寝后\N{\fnArial\fs30}retire for the night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.30,0:38:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你必须走到窗口\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must go to the windows, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.84,0:39:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}松开窗栓 打开百叶\N{\fnArial\fs30}undo the hasp, open the shutters, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.34,0:39:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}点一盏灯放在窗台上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leave your lamp on the window sill{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.06,0:39:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我们发信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a signal to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.81,0:39:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后带上你需要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then withdraw with anything you may want{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.14,0:39:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回你以前的屋里过夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the night to your old room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.10,0:39:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信 尽管那里在改造\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no doubt that, in spite of the repairs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.86,0:39:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但呆一晚还不成问题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could manage there for one night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.65,0:39:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.36,0:39:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, we must leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.65,0:39:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果罗依罗德医生回来发现我们在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Dr. Roylott should return and find us here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.82,0:39:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们这趟就白跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}our journey would be in vain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.45,0:39:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.87,0:39:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已经有了论断\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you've already made up your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.12,0:39:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请行行好\N{\fnArial\fs30}For pity sake, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.54,0:39:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我姐姐是怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell me the cause of my sister's death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.21,0:39:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}勇敢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be brave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.01,0:39:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你照我说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do as I have told you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.59,0:39:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保证很快就能消除\N{\fnArial\fs30}rest assured we shall soon drive away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.13,0:39:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对你的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}the dangers that threaten you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.58,0:40:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 看得很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is a clear view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.76,0:40:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得要守一整夜吗 福尔摩斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you expecting this to take all night, Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.35,0:40:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有可能 什么都有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's possible, anything's possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.11,0:40:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当一个医生开始作恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}When a doctor goes wrong, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.45,0:40:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他会是首屈一指的罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}he is the first of criminals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.87,0:40:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有胆识 有知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has nerve, he has knowledge, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.58,0:40:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帕默和普利查德就是他们这行的代表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Palmer and Pritchard were among the heads of their profession, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.17,0:40:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而这个人更高深莫测\N{\fnArial\fs30}this man strikes even deeper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.26,0:41:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确实有些犹豫是否该带你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really have some scruples taking you tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.85,0:41:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次显然有致命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a distinct element of danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.93,0:41:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要我能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can be of assistance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.10,0:41:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very kind of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.37,0:41:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那间屋子里 你显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}You evidently saw more in those rooms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.83,0:41:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到的比我多 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}than was visible to me, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.21,0:41:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 可我推断的比较多\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I probably deduced a little more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.38,0:41:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还记得斯通小姐说过的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember Miss Stoner said{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.92,0:41:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她姐姐可以闻到\N{\fnArial\fs30}that her sister could smell{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.63,0:41:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗依罗德医生的雪茄？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Roylott's cigar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.47,0:41:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.97,0:41:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通风口 是通风口造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ventilator, a ventilator made, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.97,0:41:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一条悬着的绳索 一位女人躺在床上 死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a cord hung, and a woman who lies in the bed, dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.31,0:41:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看不出有什么联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see any connection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.02,0:42:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你注意到床有什么特别了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you notice anything peculiar about the bed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.49,0:42:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被固定在地板上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was clamped to the floor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.29,0:42:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它动不了 固定在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could not be moved, had to remain in the same{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.08,0:42:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对着通风口和铃绳\N{\fnArial\fs30}relative position to the ventilator and the rope, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.13,0:42:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者所谓铃绳 因为很显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}or so we may call it, since it was clearly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.01,0:42:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它从来不是打铃用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}never made for a bell pull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.89,0:42:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我似乎有点明白你的意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I begin to see dimly what you're driving at.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.85,0:42:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们正好赶上阻止一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're only just in time to prevent some{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.69,0:42:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阴险而可怕的犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}subtle and horrible crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.85,0:43:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.11,0:44:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天过得好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have a good day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.11,0:44:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倒有些趣事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not without interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.45,0:44:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你早晨去哪儿了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get to this morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.25,0:44:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也去了城里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I decided to go to town, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.67,0:44:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得为婚礼置办些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had some shopping to do for the wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.88,0:44:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道我也要去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew I was going up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.01,0:44:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可以一起走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we might have traveled together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.06,0:44:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我走得早些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left early.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.89,0:44:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.11,0:44:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是为了在午饭前赶回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that I should be back by lunchtime, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.69,0:44:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我下午还有些事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had some things to do here this afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.41,0:44:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是心血来潮跑去的伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}My trip was a whim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.08,0:45:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一直就是个小撒谎精\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always were a good little liar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.17,0:45:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉失陪了 我头痛得厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll excuse me, I have a terrible headache.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.51,0:45:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 爱管闲事的 福尔摩斯 挑事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, the meddler, Holmes, the busybody, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.02,0:45:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 苏格兰场芝麻官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holmes, the Scotland Yard Jack-in-office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.48,0:46:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.60,0:46:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天 那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, what's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.43,0:46:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那只狒狒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the baboon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.93,0:46:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多好的一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a nice household.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.63,0:47:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不能点灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must sit without light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.53,0:47:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别睡着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not fall asleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.49,0:47:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的性命取决于此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your very life may depend upon it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.28,0:49:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到了吗 华生 看到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see it, Watson, you see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.88,0:49:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can it mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.88,0:50:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means it is over, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.88,0:50:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许 这是最好的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}and perhaps, for the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.89,0:50:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来 华生 带上枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come Watson, bring your pistol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.74,0:50:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是带子 斑点带子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the band, the speckled band, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.41,0:50:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是条沼泽蝰蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is a swamp adder, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.75,0:50:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}产于印度的致命毒蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}the deadliest snake in India.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.08,0:50:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他被咬后几秒内就死去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has died within seconds of being bitten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.59,0:51:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}施暴者 确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Violence does, in truth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.43,0:51:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会被自己的暴行所害\N{\fnArial\fs30}recoil upon the violent, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.05,0:51:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阴谋家最终埋葬于\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the schemer falls into the pit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.06,0:51:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自己给别人挖的坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}which he digs for another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.56,0:51:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想到是蛇是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}The idea of a snake occurred to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.06,0:51:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我联想起\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I coupled it with the knowledge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.86,0:51:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医生能够得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the Doctor was furnished{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.57,0:51:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}各种印度动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a supply of creatures from India.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.49,0:51:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一种毒药 快速且至命\N{\fnArial\fs30}A form of poison, rapid and lethal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.07,0:51:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且不会被\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which couldn't possibly be discovered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.49,0:51:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任何化学检测查出\N{\fnArial\fs30}by any chemical test.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.99,0:51:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它可能会咬 也可能不会咬\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might, or might not bite{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.16,0:51:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}躺在床上的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the occupant of the bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.08,0:51:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她可能幸运地逃脱一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}She might escape every night for a week, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.17,0:51:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但迟早\N{\fnArial\fs30}but sooner or later, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.79,0:52:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她会成为牺牲品\N{\fnArial\fs30}she must fall a victim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.42,0:52:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的朱丽亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my poor Julia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.80,0:52:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医生训练了蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Doctor had trained the snake, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.59,0:52:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能是用牛奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}probably with the milk, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.26,0:52:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用哨音把它召回\N{\fnArial\fs30}to return at the sound of a whistle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.72,0:52:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个哨音\N{\fnArial\fs30}the very whistle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.97,0:52:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是你和你姐姐都听到过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}which you and your late sister heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.19,0:52:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我检查了医生屋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My inspection of the chair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.60,0:52:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那把椅子 发现他\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Dr. Roylott's room had shown that he{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.36,0:52:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有站在椅子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}had been in the habit of standing upon it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.27,0:52:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}够通风口的习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}to reach the ventilator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.78,0:52:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨晚我袭击了那条蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night when I attacked the snake{\r}
